"wp-block-paragraph\">We do <strong>not<\/strong> use your personal information for unrelated marketing without your consent.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Data Sharing and Disclosure<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>We <strong>do not sell, rent, or trade<\/strong> your personal information to third parties.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Your data may be shared only with authorized staff within the clinic for appointment management.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>We may disclose information if required by law or legal authorities.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Data Security<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We take appropriate security measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, misuse, or disclosure. While we strive to use commercially acceptable means to protect your data, no system is completely secure.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Data Retention<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Your information is retained only as long as necessary for appointment management and patient communication, or as required by applicable laws.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Your Rights<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You have the right to:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Request access to your personal information<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Request correction of incorrect or outdated details<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Request deletion of your data (subject to legal obligations)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Children&#8217;s Privacy<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our services are not specifically directed toward children. However, information provided for minors will be handled with the same level of care and confidentiality.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Changes to This Policy<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Dr Dilip Dental Centre reserves the right to update this Privacy Policy at any time. Any changes will be posted on our website or communicated appropriately.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Contact Us<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you have any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy or your personal data, please contact:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Dr Dilip Dental Centre<\/strong><br>Chennai, India<br>\ud83d\udcde Phone: +91 9884 520 520<br>\ud83d\udce7 Email: doctor@dilipdentalcentre.com<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>At Dr Dilip Dental Centre, we are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring the safety of your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard the information you provide when interacting with our clinic, website, or appointment systems. By using our services, you agree to the terms outlined in this [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-3","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/3","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=3"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/3\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5133,"href":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/3\/revisions\/5133"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=3"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api